     *
     *     ModuleConfig::OPTION_BACKCHANNEL_LOGOUT_HTTP_CLIENT_OPTIONS => [
     *         'verify' => false,
     *     ],
     *
     * SECURITY WARNING: disabling TLS verification ('verify' => false) exposes these requests to
